Short:        Bug fix for Amiga SAS/C 6.0, 6.1, and 6.2.
Type:         dev/c
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

This is a set of binary patches for the Amiga SAS/C Development System,
Versions 6.0, 6.1 or 6.2.  It requires the original seven-disk set that
came with the SAS/C Development System package.  It does not require that
you install the 6.1 or 6.2 patch; all fixes present in 6.1 and 6.2 are
included in this patch.

This patch is freely redistributable; further information can be found in
the archive in the file marked README.
